If you don't know the name of the first column and you want to remove it based solely on its position, you'd need to use arrays and a loop, which is more complex than necessary in this scenario, given that you seem to know which variables you want to retain.  Stick with the `KEEP` statement unless you have a very specific reason to remove variables by position.

